{"title":"","link":"http://scripting.com/2025/11/02.html#a105056","date":1762080656000,"content":"In August 2002 I <a href=\"http://scripting.com/2002/08.html#When:10:23:25AM\">asked</a> why RSS 1.0 is named RSS? I gathered up <a href=\"http://essaysfromexodus.scripting.com/whyRss10NamedRss\">opinions</a> from people and published it as a single document. I didn't edit or respond, just let people speak.","author":"","siteTitle":"Scripting News","siteHash":"d6ad59631287cc248e52fdfe0c4f962c0fd08643d455b40f799700d8b2f97c65","entryHash":"a5da4969b521c203d4a02fa5113838841b6433c3c95f67b08151f8497ac92117","category":"Sites"}